            {
                "entry_id": "12923b62-44c5-30e2-97cb-3d470bc5735d",
                "word": "Grexit",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "da3414ee-ce75-3586-84d4-a156a7f5a255",
                        "entry_id": "12923b62-44c5-30e2-97cb-3d470bc5735d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Scénario de sortie de la Grèce de la zone euro."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4922cce-4821-4176-be61-a26e7e352b3b",
                                "sense_id": "da3414ee-ce75-3586-84d4-a156a7f5a255",
                                "text": "La menace allemande de ne rien faire pour empêcher le « Grexit », la sortie de la Grèce de la zone euro, publiée ce lundi par une indiscrétion de l’hebdomadaire Der Spiegel, a déjà fait couler beaucoup d’encre."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30a97f15-aa89-4d29-acfe-9a2ea72b2f3d",
                        "source_entry_id": "12923b62-44c5-30e2-97cb-3d470bc5735d",
                        "source_sense_id": "da3414ee-ce75-3586-84d4-a156a7f5a255",
                        "source_sense_description": "Sortie de la Grèce de la zone euro",
                        "target_lang_word": "Grexit",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Grexit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9996b04-515d-3645-9fa4-fd0b52ac70e8",
                                        "entry_id": "4453312e-7d0c-309e-8697-df9cbf7f0a00",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The potential withdrawal of Greece from the Eurozone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d2db508-2724-4569-82c3-b2d56b3c8f52",
                                                "sense_id": "f9996b04-515d-3645-9fa4-fd0b52ac70e8",
                                                "text": "We raise our estimate of the likelihood of Greek EA exit (‘Grexit’) to 50% over the next 18 months, from 25-30% previously. This is mostly because we consider the willingness of EA creditors to continue providing further support to Greece despite Greek non-compliance with programme conditionality to have fallen substantially."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e2f4d5f-2115-4b4e-b2b1-27e4555b45e6",
                                                "sense_id": "f9996b04-515d-3645-9fa4-fd0b52ac70e8",
                                                "text": "Citigroup economists Willem Buiter and Ebrahim Rabhari revised their predictions of a Greek exit from the eurozone—or \"Grexit\"—in the next 18 months up to 50 percent from 25-30 percent in November."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3fdd620-7989-43ed-a209-fb0350dd9cfe",
                                                "sense_id": "f9996b04-515d-3645-9fa4-fd0b52ac70e8",
                                                "text": "The bankers, however, were alarmingly precise: amid all the speculation about Grexit, they told me, banks are increasingly reordering their European exposure along national lines, in terms of asset-liability matching (ALM), just in case the region splits apart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f2b1cd4-5631-43a6-8e98-1a29eabec927",
                                                "sense_id": "f9996b04-515d-3645-9fa4-fd0b52ac70e8",
                                                "text": "Throughout 2012, economists speculated on the likelihood of the Grexit by 2013."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5de7001d-7f4c-4f48-9614-0479383ca510",
                                                "sense_id": "f9996b04-515d-3645-9fa4-fd0b52ac70e8",
                                                "text": "Around the middle of 2012, speculation was rife about the likelihood of the so-called Grexit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00cd8255-451f-4ff7-a959-800d3e087069",
                                                "sense_id": "f9996b04-515d-3645-9fa4-fd0b52ac70e8",
                                                "text": "Grexit, in short, would have left the way open to German monetary independence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9027c40e-e192-4745-ac2a-01542f7dd6dd",
                                                "sense_id": "f9996b04-515d-3645-9fa4-fd0b52ac70e8",
                                                "text": "Regarding the relationship with the EU after the Grexit he remains agnostic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d66a0d9-2fbc-4f76-b884-3a1ed34c30c8",
                        "source_entry_id": "12923b62-44c5-30e2-97cb-3d470bc5735d",
                        "source_sense_id": "da3414ee-ce75-3586-84d4-a156a7f5a255",
                        "source_sense_description": "Sortie de la Grèce de la zone euro",
                        "target_lang_word": "Grexit",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6d785d72-a6a5-4736-8e0e-00422432b7fd",
                        "source_entry_id": "12923b62-44c5-30e2-97cb-3d470bc5735d",
                        "source_sense_id": "da3414ee-ce75-3586-84d4-a156a7f5a255",
